        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A troupe of wandering cats performing across the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But a witch, who disliked the sound of their performances,  cast a curse on them...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the cats who have turned into blocks because of the witch’s curse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A puzzle game where you match three cat blocks to rescue the cats trapped inside the blocks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire cats with the Z key</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch position before firing with the X key</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire special cats with the Spacebar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retrieve and relaunch dropped cats with the C key</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Objective</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035630/extras/eabd54e97bf70eeed67bb40302114c8b.avif?t=1763823407\" width=144 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match 3 or more cats to level up and strengthen cat blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With stronger cat blocks, aim for the highest score within 600 seconds!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035630/extras/20a5f7f2deedd71236193dc90528fce4.avif?t=1763823407\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When all cats are upgraded, you can enter the shop upon leveling up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shop, you can purchase time, score boosts, or further enhance the equipment of normal cats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synchro</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035630/extras/240785c0b07e26ea9e19ded45dd83fed.avif?t=1763823407\" width=256 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When certain conditions are met, additional effects will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match the right combinations to achieve higher scores.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>When There’s No Place to Put Cats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you stack blocks incorrectly and have no space to place cats, press R to clear the cats on the map.<br>(However, some score and time will be deducted.)</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A troupe of wandering cats performing across the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But a witch, who disliked the sound of their performances,  cast a curse on them...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the cats who have turned into blocks because of the witch’s curse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A puzzle game where you match three cat blocks to rescue the cats trapped inside the blocks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire cats with the Z key</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch position before firing with the X key</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire special cats with the Spacebar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retrieve and relaunch dropped cats with the C key</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Objective</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035630/extras/eabd54e97bf70eeed67bb40302114c8b.avif?t=1763823407\" width=144 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match 3 or more cats to level up and strengthen cat blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With stronger cat blocks, aim for the highest score within 600 seconds!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035630/extras/20a5f7f2deedd71236193dc90528fce4.avif?t=1763823407\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When all cats are upgraded, you can enter the shop upon leveling up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shop, you can purchase time, score boosts, or further enhance the equipment of normal cats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synchro</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035630/extras/240785c0b07e26ea9e19ded45dd83fed.avif?t=1763823407\" width=256 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When certain conditions are met, additional effects will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match the right combinations to achieve higher scores.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>When There’s No Place to Put Cats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you stack blocks incorrectly and have no space to place cats, press R to clear the cats on the map.<br>(However, some score and time will be deducted.)</p>",
